Return EXACTLY 5 different rules. Put EACH rule in its own separate ```python code block; each block must be self-contained and define one function `def priority(task, state)` (optionally with extra keyword constants with numeric defaults) returning a float, higher = dispatched first. Only `math` may be imported. Protect divisions with max(x, 1e-6). Write no text outside the code blocks.

